FIX-T01 三方映射一致性核对日志（只读；60 张任务卡「评分/要求」× 00_execution_map.md §8 × task_manifest.requirements）
工作目录：D:\dianzi ；解释器：E:\miniconda\python.exe（Python 3.13.11，仅标准库）；日期：2026-09-30（+08:00）
说明：脚本以 E:\miniconda\python.exe -c <内联脚本> 执行，未在仓库内落任何脚本文件；逐任务比对三方的评分/要求集合（顺序无关），
      任一方缺失或集合不同即记 DIFF。内联脚本正文（与实际执行一致；行内 ` 为反引号字符）：

  import datetime, json, re
  from pathlib import Path
  start = datetime.datetime.now()
  root = Path(r"D:\dianzi")
  manifest = json.loads((root / "contracts" / "task_manifest.json").read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
  tasks = manifest["tasks"]
  section8 = {}
  lines = (root / "docs" / "plan" / "00_execution_map.md").read_text(encoding="utf-8").splitlines()
  in_section = False
  for line in lines:
      if line.startswith("## 8."):
          in_section = True
          continue
      if in_section and line.startswith("## "):
          break
      if in_section:
          m = re.match(r"^\|\s*`(T\d\d)`\s*\|", line)
          if m:
              cells = [c.strip() for c in line.strip().strip("|").split("|")]
              section8[m.group(1)] = [x for x in re.split(r"[、,，]", cells[3]) if x]
  cards = {}
  for path in sorted((root / "docs" / "tasks").glob("T*.md")):
      tid = path.name.split("_")[0]
      for line in path.read_text(encoding="utf-8").splitlines():
          if "评分/要求：" in line:
              cards[tid] = [x for x in re.split(r"[、,，]", line.split("评分/要求：", 1)[1].strip()) if x]
              break
  print("CROSSCHECK_START=%s" % start.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%f"))
  print("cards=%d section8_rows=%d manifest_tasks=%d" % (len(cards), len(section8), len(tasks)))
  diffs = []
  for tid in sorted(tasks):
      man = sorted(tasks[tid].get("requirements", []))
      s8 = sorted(section8[tid]) if tid in section8 else None
      card = sorted(cards[tid]) if tid in cards else None
      if s8 != man or card != man:
          diffs.append((tid, man, s8, card))
  for tid, man, s8, card in diffs:
      print("DIFF", tid, "manifest=", man, "section8=", s8, "card=", card)
  print("DIFF_COUNT = %d" % len(diffs))
  print("CROSSCHECK_END=%s" % datetime.datetime.now().strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%f"))

